 record, not a person: it is drawn for this record alone, never derived"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the device, the user, the session or another record, and two records never share one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collector that receives a record twice, as a redelivered record can be, keeps one copy by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/id":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it had when first delivered."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id","title":"id","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/id","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/events","type":"topic","title":"Events","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The types every other module shares: the "},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tra